# Git converts line endings on checkout when core.autocrlf is on, which it is
# by default on Windows and on GitHub's Windows runners. gofmt treats a file
# with CRLF as unformatted, so without this the formatting check fails on
# Windows and passes everywhere else — for reasons that have nothing to do
# with the code.
#
# Keeping LF in the working tree on every platform makes the check mean the
# same thing wherever it runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
